# Audit Remediation Strategy
RULE: Empty fallbacks → fix ALL (fail loud). Low coverage → tests + linters in parallel. Any types → replace with specific. Lazy imports → keep for optional deps.
WHY: Systematic approach prioritizes work; parallel execution speeds remediation.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/audit-remediation-guide.md, .cursor/rules/no-empty-fallbacks.mdc
DO: Use parallel agents for cross-repo; run quality gates before commit; check QUALITY_GATE_BYPASS_AUDIT for exceptions
NEVER: Fix only critical config; skip tests to pass gates; add baselines instead of fixing
